        "text": "Olivea Marx v. General Revenue Corporation concerns whether the Federal Fair Debt Collection Practices Act (FDCPA) provision on costs displaces the general award\u2011of\u2011costs rule in Rule\u202f54(d)."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
